  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The investigation into the unauthorized wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto has expanded to include allegations of treason. Bareskrim Polri has identified several suspects previously linked to the wiretapping activities as witnesses in this broader treason inquiry. Political figures and observers have noted the potential involvement of intellectual actors and couriers tasked with distributing the intercepted data. There is ongoing debate among legislators regarding the appropriate legal framework for the case, with some questioning the application of the Electronic Information and Transactions Law in favor of more severe treason charges. Reports indicate that the government, through the National Security Council, has convened discussions with the BSSN, the military, and the police to assess interception governance and security protocols. President Prabowo has previously alluded to internal intrigues and sabotage following the discovery of the breach.",
